<br/>
<br/>As always, everything revolves around reaching and maintaining the 2005 haste breakpoint. Strangely enough, because there's often only one or two options per slot, it doesn't really become that much easier to mix up gear around the breakpoint. Instead, we're still very tightly bound by it and restricted in what items to choose. Therefore during your gearing journey, you may find yourself avoiding some non-haste upgrades just to stay at the breakpoint.<br/>
<br/>Other than making or breaking the 2005 Haste breakpoint, due to reforging, most items are functionally equivalent to each other as long as they're the same item level. Intellect itself remains extremely powerful compared to any secondary stat, meaning that differences between same-ilvl gear are small.<br/>
<br/>Overall, this means that for our gearing strategy, there isn't necessarily a single "best option" per item level if multiple items at the same ilvl exist. This excludes trinkets, which have an entirely separate grading scale that you should consult the table for. <br/>
